### Get TenantRate by ID
GET https://localhost:7053/api/biller/tenantrate/1

### Get all TenantRates
GET https://localhost:7053/api/biller/tenantrate

### Lookup TenantRates
GET https://localhost:7053/api/biller/tenantrate/lookup

### Create TenantRate
POST https://localhost:7053/api/biller/tenantrate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ID": 0,
  "TenantID": 0,
  "RateTypeID": "Sample",
  "CompanyID": 0,
  "ContactID": 0,
  "DefaultRate": "Sample",
  "Active": "Sample",
  "StartDate": "Sample",
  "EndDate": "Sample",
  "Tenant": "Sample",
  "RateType": "Sample",
  "Company": "Sample",
  "Contact": "Sample"
}

